commit \"f3149ec5bb5449af877ba20377a11008ff499fa2\"\n186:  ;;   * `bb build:jolt-native` (check-libcrypto!) fails on a canonical path\n195:  ;;   1. `bb build:jolt-native --requalify` (builds against the changed\n198:  ;;   2. `bb qualify:jolt-libcrypto` prints the observed {:canonical-path\n199:  ;;      :version-num :version :sha256} (the digest computed by bb and by\n203:  ;;   4. `bb build:jolt-native`, `bb compare:jolt-host`, `bb\n204:  ;;      probe:jolt-crypto`, all of which must pass.\n33:(def ^:private head-domain \"yin.head/trace:v1\\n\")\n194:   (to-hex (sign-bytes seed (message head-domain\n208:      (verify-message public (message head-domain canonical) signature))\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
