{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_36","type":"command_execution","command":"/bin/bash -lc \"rg --files test/dao/stream test/yin/vm/linker | rg '(datagram|head|sign)' && sed -n '118,142p' src/dev/jolt_j2_lane.clj && rg -n 'dht-composition|Gate A|Gate B|store_write|storage-implementation' test/yin/repl/*test* | head -45\"","aggregated_output":"test/dao/stream/datagram/node_test.cljs\ntest/dao/stream/datagram/dart_test.cljd\ntest/dao/stream/datagram/jvm_test.clj\ntest/dao/stream/datagram_test.cljc\ntest/yin/vm/linker/head_board_test.cljc\ntest/yin/vm/linker/head_test.cljc\ntest/yin/vm/linker/head_follow_test.cljc\ntest/yin/vm/linker/sign_vectors.edn\ntest/yin/vm/linker/sign_test.cljc\n;; test/dao/jing, test/dao/data, test/dao/space, test/dao/stream (the bare\n;; dao.{jing,stream,data}_test included), test/yin/vm, is either in\n;; `included` (run, fast and ^:slow alike) or below in `excluded` with a\n;; reason, the missing capability and its owner. Zero unexplained skips.\n(def excluded\n  [{:ns \"dao.stream.http-test\"\n    :reason \"loads dao.stream.http.jvm, the JVM http-kit adapter (b55fdfe1, dao.star Mode 1); jolt has no http-kit, so the namespace cannot load (J4d probe: load failure on org.httpkit.server)\"\n    :capability \"JVM HTTP server (http-kit)\" :owner \"dao.star\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.shell-session-test\" :reason \"JVM process corpus runs on JVM lane; bb test:jolt-shell runs both hosts\" :capability \"JVM subprocess harness\" :owner \"J3\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.dht-test\" :reason \"UDP + durable store fixture\" :capability \"UDP + durable store\" :owner \"J7\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.dht-head-test\" :reason \"WebSocket + durable store fixture\" :capability \"WebSocket + durable store\" :owner \"J6/J7\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.dht-process-test\" :reason \"JVM process + UDP fixture\" :capability \"JVM process + UDP\" :owner \"J7\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.serve-connect-wire-test\" :reason \"JVM WebSocket peers fixture\" :capability \"JVM WebSocket peers\" :owner \"J6\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.build-test\" :reason \"JVM build tool fixture\" :capability \"JVM build tool\" :owner \"J8\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.host.jvm-test\" :reason \"JDK host fixture\" :capability \"JDK host\" :owner \"J6\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.repl.host.node-test\" :reason \"Node host fixture\" :capability \"Node host\" :owner \"J6\"}\n   {:ns \"dao.host.gate-test\"\n    :reason \"the H0 freeze gate reads src text via tools.reader; its own docstring says JVM lane only\"\n    :capability \"source-text gate (tools.reader)\" :owner \"host-boundary seat\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.vm.linker.layering-test\"\n    :reason \"same gate class: reads src ns forms via tools.reader, JVM only\"\n    :capability \"source-text gate (tools.reader)\" :owner \"host-boundary seat\"}\n   {:ns \"yin.vm.store-write-audit-test\"\n    :reason \"same gate class: reads every src file as forms via tools.reader\"\n    :capability \"source-text gate (tools.reader)\" :owner \"host-boundary seat\"}\ntest/yin/repl/store_test.cljc:1447:;; Gate B).  The lifecycle tests above pin each backend's own contract;\ntest/yin/repl/index_test.cljc:149:  ;; Gate B: the same publication proof on each non-DHT backend, through\ntest/yin/repl/index_test.cljc:216:  ;; Gate B: every evaluator, on every non-DHT backend, through the\ntest/yin/repl/index_test.cljc:1215:  ;; yin-repl-dht-composition, JVM, test identifier\ntest/yin/repl/require_test.cljc:138:   the explicitly injected non-DHT `backend` (Gate B's arrangement:\ntest/yin/repl/require_test.cljc:151:   (Gate B): the link-policy and pending-run tests below are about the\ntest/yin/repl/require_test.cljc:265:  ;; Gate B: the whole prompt path on every VM and every non-DHT backend.\ntest/yin/repl/require_test.cljc:841:;; Step 1 isolation (spec section 10, Gate B): this is the one explicitly\ntest/yin/repl/build_test.clj:9:   (docs/design/yin.repl.dht-composition.md sections 2, 6 and 10, Gate A).\ntest/yin/repl/dht_head_test.cljc:78:   take (docs/design/yin.repl.dht-composition.md sections 3 and 7).\"\ntest/yin/repl/query_test.cljc:30:   (Gate B): the query tests below run on the memory selection through\ntest/yin/repl/query_test.cljc:301:  ;; Gate B: query settlement survives rollback, on every VM and every\ntest/yin/repl/query_test.cljc:338:  ;; Gate B: the guarded slow body, on every VM and non-DHT backend.\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
